@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

hide footbox

title US020 - As a user, I want to get a list (name and user) of the publicly published lists of a given genre

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor User
participant ":UI" as UI
endbox

participant ":GetListController" as GetListController
participant ":ListRepo" as ListRepo
participant ":List" as List

User -> UI : viewPublicLists (genre)
UI -> GetListController : getPublicListsByGenre(genre)

GetListController -> ListRepo : findPublicListsByGenre(genre)
ListRepo -> List : queryPublicListsByGenre(genre)

List --> ListRepo : publicLists (name, ownerUserId)
ListRepo --> GetListController : publicLists (name, ownerUserId)

GetListController --> UI : returnPublicList(name, ownerUserId)
UI --> User : Display list (name, user)
@enduml